{"seq":2,"slug":"islands-architecture","title":"Islands Architecture 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/rendering-architecture/islands-architecture","wordCount":1143,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"islands-architecture-实践\">Islands Architecture 实践</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Islands Architecture（岛屿架构）是近年来对内容为主的 Web 站点影响最深远的前端架构模式。其核心思想极为简洁：将页面大部分内容渲染为静态 HTML，仅在需要交互的位置注入独立的 JavaScript &quot;岛屿&quot;。这种选择性水合策略让典型内容站点的 JavaScript 体积从 200KB+ 降至 15KB 以下。Astro 是该架构的标杆实现，2026 年初被 Cloudflare 收购后发布了 Astro 6，引入了 Server Islands 和基于 workerd 的开发服务器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"选择性水合-vs-全量水合\">选择性水合 vs 全量水合</h3><p>传统 SPA 框架（React、Vue）对整个页面进行 hydration——即使页面中 90% 的内容是纯展示性的。Islands Architecture 只对需要交互的组件进行 hydration，其余部分保持为零 JavaScript 的静态 HTML。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Traditional SPA&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;Full page hydration&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;80-120KB+ React runtime&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[&quot;All components hydrated&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Islands Architecture&quot;&#10;        B1[&quot;Static HTML shell&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;0KB default JS&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt; B3[&quot;Island: Search Widget 5KB&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt; B4[&quot;Island: Cart Badge 3KB&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt; B5[&quot;Island: Image Carousel 7KB&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Traditional SPA\"\n        A1[\"Full page hydration\"] --&gt; A2[\"80-120KB+ React runtime\"]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[\"All components hydrated\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Islands Architecture\"\n        B1[\"Static HTML shell\"] --&gt; B2[\"0KB default JS\"]\n        B1 --&gt; B3[\"Island: Search Widget 5KB\"]\n        B1 --&gt; B4[\"Island: Cart Badge 3KB\"]\n        B1 --&gt; B5[\"Island: Image Carousel 7KB\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"client-islands-vs-server-islands\">Client Islands vs Server Islands</h3><p>Astro 6 引入了两种岛屿类型：</p>\n<p><strong>Client Islands</strong>：传统的交互式组件，在浏览器中 hydrate 并响应用户操作。通过 <code>client:*</code> 指令控制加载时机。</p>\n<p><strong>Server Islands</strong>：在服务器端渲染动态/个性化内容的组件，无需客户端 JavaScript。适用于需要鉴权、数据库访问的场景（用户头像、购物车数量等）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Client Island - 需要用户交互&#10;// src/components/SearchWidget.tsx&#10;import { useState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function SearchWidget() {&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const [results, setResults] = useState([]);&#10;&#10;  const handleSearch = async (e: React.FormEvent) =&gt; {&#10;    e.preventDefault();&#10;    const res = await fetch(`/api/search?q=${query}`);&#10;    setResults(await res.json());&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;form onSubmit={handleSearch}&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={query} onChange={e =&gt; setQuery(e.target.value)} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot;&gt;Search&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;ul&gt;{results.map(r =&gt; &lt;li key={r.id}&gt;{r.title}&lt;/li&gt;)}&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;/form&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Client Island - 需要用户交互</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/components/SearchWidget.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useState } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SearchWidget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">results</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setResults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleSearch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> React</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FormEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">preventDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/search?q=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setResults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">form onSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handleSearch}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{query} onChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.target.value)} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Search</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ul</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{results.map(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">li</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}>{r.title}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">li</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ul</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">form</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"astro\" data-code=\"---&#10;// src/pages/blog.astro&#10;import { SearchWidget } from &#39;../components/SearchWidget&#39;;&#10;import { UserAvatar } from &#39;../components/UserAvatar&#39;;&#10;---&#10;&lt;html&gt;&#10;&lt;body&gt;&#10;  &lt;header&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- Server Island: 服务端渲染个性化内容，零客户端 JS --&gt;&#10;    &lt;UserAvatar server:defer&gt;&#10;      &lt;p slot=&quot;fallback&quot;&gt;Loading...&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;/UserAvatar&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;!-- Client Island: 只在可见时加载 --&gt;&#10;    &lt;SearchWidget client:visible /&gt;&#10;  &lt;/header&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;!-- 纯静态内容: 零 JavaScript --&gt;&#10;  &lt;main&gt;&#10;    &lt;article&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;Blog Post Title&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;This content is pure static HTML. No JS shipped.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;/article&gt;&#10;  &lt;/main&gt;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// src/pages/blog.astro</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { SearchWidget } from '../components/SearchWidget';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { UserAvatar } from '../components/UserAvatar';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;html></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;header></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;!-- Server Island: 服务端渲染个性化内容，零客户端 JS --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;UserAvatar server:defer></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p slot=\"fallback\">Loading...&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/UserAvatar></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;!-- Client Island: 只在可见时加载 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;SearchWidget client:visible /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/header></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- 纯静态内容: 零 JavaScript --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;article></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h1>Blog Post Title&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p>This content is pure static HTML. No JS shipped.&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/article></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/body></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/html></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"加载策略指令\">加载策略指令</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>client:load</code></td>\n<td>页面加载时立即 hydrate</td>\n<td>首屏必须交互的组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>client:idle</code></td>\n<td>浏览器空闲时 hydrate</td>\n<td>非关键交互（评论框）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>client:visible</code></td>\n<td>进入视口时 hydrate</td>\n<td>折叠下方的组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>client:media</code></td>\n<td>媒体查询匹配时 hydrate</td>\n<td>仅桌面端的组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>client:only</code></td>\n<td>跳过 SSR，仅客户端渲染</td>\n<td>依赖浏览器 API 的组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>server:defer</code></td>\n<td>服务端异步渲染</td>\n<td>个性化内容 (Astro 6)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"从零搭建-astro-6-islands-项目\">从零搭建 Astro 6 Islands 项目</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 创建 Astro 6 项目&#10;npm create astro@latest my-site -- --template blog&#10;cd my-site&#10;&#10;# 添加 React 集成（也可以是 Vue、Svelte、Solid）&#10;npx astro add react&#10;&#10;# 添加 Cloudflare 适配器&#10;npx astro add cloudflare\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建 Astro 6 项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> astro@latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-site</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --template</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-site</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加 React 集成（也可以是 Vue、Svelte、Solid）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> astro</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> react</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加 Cloudflare 适配器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> astro</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cloudflare</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// astro.config.mjs&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;astro/config&#39;;&#10;import react from &#39;@astrojs/react&#39;;&#10;import cloudflare from &#39;@astrojs/cloudflare&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  output: &#39;hybrid&#39;,&#10;  adapter: cloudflare(),&#10;  integrations: [react()],&#10;  experimental: {&#10;    serverIslands: true, // Astro 6 Server Islands&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// astro.config.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'astro/config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> react </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@astrojs/react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cloudflare </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@astrojs/cloudflare'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  output: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hybrid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  adapter: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cloudflare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  integrations: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">react</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  experimental: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    serverIslands: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Astro 6 Server Islands</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多框架混合使用\">多框架混合使用</h3><p>Islands Architecture 的独特优势之一是支持在同一页面中混合使用不同 UI 框架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"astro\" data-code=\"---&#10;// 同一页面使用 React + Vue + Svelte&#10;import { ReactCounter } from &#39;../components/ReactCounter&#39;;&#10;import VueWidget from &#39;../components/VueWidget.vue&#39;;&#10;import SvelteChart from &#39;../components/SvelteChart.svelte&#39;;&#10;---&#10;&lt;main&gt;&#10;  &lt;ReactCounter client:visible /&gt;&#10;  &lt;VueWidget client:idle /&gt;&#10;  &lt;SvelteChart client:load /&gt;&#10;&lt;/main&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 同一页面使用 React + Vue + Svelte</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ReactCounter } from '../components/ReactCounter';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import VueWidget from '../components/VueWidget.vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import SvelteChart from '../components/SvelteChart.svelte';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;ReactCounter client:visible /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;VueWidget client:idle /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;SvelteChart client:load /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/main></span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种能力让团队可以渐进式迁移框架——先用 Astro 包裹现有组件作为 Islands，再逐步替换。</p>\n<h3 id=\"性能对比实测数据\">性能对比实测数据</h3><p>基于真实生产站点的对比数据（130+ 页面内容站点）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>WordPress (Before)</th>\n<th>Astro Islands (After)</th>\n<th>提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Lighthouse Performance</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>98</td>\n<td>+58%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>First Contentful Paint</td>\n<td>2.8s</td>\n<td>0.6s</td>\n<td>79% faster</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Largest Contentful Paint</td>\n<td>4.1s</td>\n<td>1.0s</td>\n<td>76% faster</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Total Blocking Time</td>\n<td>450ms</td>\n<td>10ms</td>\n<td>98% 减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JavaScript shipped</td>\n<td>~350KB</td>\n<td>0-15KB</td>\n<td>96% 减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月托管成本</td>\n<td>$25/month</td>\n<td>$0/month (Cloudflare Pages)</td>\n<td>100% 减少</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"content-collections-与类型安全\">Content Collections 与类型安全</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/content/config.ts&#10;import { defineCollection, z } from &#39;astro:content&#39;;&#10;&#10;const blog = defineCollection({&#10;  type: &#39;content&#39;,&#10;  schema: z.object({&#10;    title: z.string(),&#10;    description: z.string(),&#10;    pubDate: z.coerce.date(),&#10;    tags: z.array(z.string()).default([]),&#10;    draft: z.boolean().default(false),&#10;  }),&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const collections = { blog };&#10;&#10;// src/pages/blog/[slug].astro&#10;---&#10;import { getCollection } from &#39;astro:content&#39;;&#10;export async function getStaticPaths() {&#10;  const posts = await getCollection(&#39;blog&#39;, ({ data }) =&gt; !data.draft);&#10;  return posts.map(post =&gt; ({&#10;    params: { slug: post.slug },&#10;    props: { post },&#10;  }));&#10;}&#10;const { post } = Astro.props;&#10;const { Content } = await post.render();&#10;---&#10;&lt;article&gt;&#10;  &lt;h1&gt;{post.data.title}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;  &lt;Content /&gt;&#10;&lt;/article&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/content/config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineCollection, z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'astro:content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blog</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineCollection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span cl